From 87aa140df4fc326bbfafe14df7a4860d2ac9ae55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:03:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Recover killed update HEAD locks and escalate
 repeated ref lock failures

Keep receipt ownership and live-holder proofs for HEAD.lock recovery. Classify ref-lock failures separately, record their generation in receipts, and file one idempotent diagnostic card after two distinct failed runs.

Proof: 118 focused tests pass; consumer mutations removing receipt observation or either command identity seam fail. Worker-8 recovered via existing age-floor sweep; producer attribution remains unproven (mtime/reclaim correlation only).
